WEBVTT

00:19.570 --> 00:23.270
<i>Gokusen</i>

00:23.540 --> 00:28.780
<i>How long has it been</i>
<i>since that day when we first met?</i>

00:28.950 --> 00:34.480
<i>So many good times and bad times</i>
<i>have come and gone since then.</i>

00:34.650 --> 00:39.820
<i>I know you can't make sense</i>
<i>of what I'm trying to say.</i>

00:39.990 --> 00:45.260
<i>But my true feelings for you</i>
<i>can never be put into words.</i>

00:45.570 --> 00:51.000
<i>Will you ever know how I feel?</i>
<i>Will you ever know what's going on inside me?</i>

00:51.200 --> 00:56.640
<i>If only we could live in a world where</i>
<i>you only have to be yourself and smile.</i>

00:56.810 --> 01:02.080
<i>Or is it always going to be like this?</i>
<i>Will we be able to go on like this?</i>

01:02.280 --> 01:09.990
<i>Even if you're far away, I want to</i>
<i>feel you in my heart, close to me.</i>

01:21.270 --> 01:23.740
I can't wait! Okinawa...

01:23.840 --> 01:25.400
It's going to be great.

01:25.510 --> 01:28.200
Ms. Yamaguchi, you're bringing
a swimsuit, aren't you?

01:28.580 --> 01:29.600
Oh, right!

01:29.710 --> 01:31.700
It's warm enough to swim there.

01:31.950 --> 01:34.920
If you wanted to,
you could swim all year long.

01:35.010 --> 01:37.640
The sparkling ocean,
the glaring sunlight!

01:37.750 --> 01:41.810
Stop yapping like a couple of
screamy teenagers, will you?

01:42.020 --> 01:44.350
Screamy teenagers, eh?

01:44.460 --> 01:46.820
Well, "ignorance is bliss," as they say.

01:46.930 --> 01:48.900
What is it we don't know?

01:49.030 --> 01:50.120
Think about it!

01:50.330 --> 01:52.770
A school trip with those delinquents.

01:52.870 --> 01:56.000
We've never come back
from one unscathed.

01:56.370 --> 01:59.830
They brawl with kids from other
schools and the police show up...

01:59.970 --> 02:02.240
They destroy hotel property...

02:02.410 --> 02:04.710
They peek into the women's bath...

02:06.350 --> 02:09.440
I would have liked to
accompany you on this trip.

02:09.550 --> 02:11.210
It's unfortunate.

02:11.820 --> 02:13.180
Vice Principal...

02:13.290 --> 02:16.380
As you know, our students
can get quite rambunctious.

02:16.490 --> 02:20.090
But I'm sure it will be fine,
with you people in charge.

02:20.230 --> 02:23.390
Still, if for any reason the
students do cause some disaster...

02:23.500 --> 02:26.960
...there will be serious consequences.

02:27.930 --> 02:31.700
Suddenly I'm getting a really
bad feeling about this trip...

02:32.270 --> 02:33.740
What the hell is this?

02:34.040 --> 02:36.600
Only one lousy day of free time?

02:36.710 --> 02:38.300
A 6 pm curfew?

02:38.410 --> 02:39.710
This is bullshit!

02:39.810 --> 02:41.280
It's worse than junior high!

02:41.410 --> 02:42.400
Hey, guys...

02:43.320 --> 02:45.620
I heard that last year,
some guys snuck out...

02:45.720 --> 02:47.710
...of the hotel late at night
and hit the town.

02:47.820 --> 02:49.450
They snuck out?

02:50.120 --> 02:52.020
Good idea! We can do the same!

02:52.560 --> 02:55.550
This school trip's gonna be a blast!

02:56.200 --> 03:01.160
<i>The Class Trip into Hell Begins!</i>

03:01.470 --> 03:02.560
Ojou...

03:02.870 --> 03:06.470
I sincerely hope nothing
happens during your trip.

03:09.110 --> 03:12.410
Please, take care of yourself.

03:24.820 --> 03:25.660
All right!

03:25.790 --> 03:28.490
Remember to be on your best behavior!

03:28.600 --> 03:32.500
You are not to disturb other
tourists, okay? You got that?

03:33.270 --> 03:33.960
Crap!

03:34.100 --> 03:35.900
Nobody's paying attention.

03:36.000 --> 03:36.470
Huh?

03:36.540 --> 03:38.230
Wait a minute, you asshole!

03:39.540 --> 03:41.740
You're the one who bumped into me!

03:41.840 --> 03:44.240
You're an outsider,
don't give me that shit!

03:44.340 --> 03:45.330
Goddamn you!

03:45.450 --> 03:46.340
You wanna fight?

03:46.450 --> 03:47.310
Go for it!

03:48.010 --> 03:49.310
Okay, that's enough!

03:49.620 --> 03:50.550
Yankumi!

03:50.650 --> 03:51.880
Who the hell are you?

03:52.020 --> 03:53.880
I'm his homeroom teacher.

03:54.120 --> 03:57.180
Could we please just
settle this amicably?

03:57.290 --> 03:57.990
Huh?

03:58.120 --> 03:59.620
Back off, teach!

04:01.430 --> 04:02.690
Could we please...

04:03.500 --> 04:06.560
...just settle this amicably?

04:11.200 --> 04:12.000
All right?

04:13.370 --> 04:15.840
Watch where you're going next time!

04:18.380 --> 04:19.210
Retard!

04:19.310 --> 04:20.640
Don't mess with me!

04:29.060 --> 04:30.850
We can forget this place!

04:30.960 --> 04:32.620
Cancel the tour!

04:32.730 --> 04:34.090
What's the matter?

04:34.190 --> 04:38.820
It would be like throwing
lambs to the wolves.

04:45.100 --> 04:46.540
Little lambs!

04:46.640 --> 04:48.630
Let's get a move on!

04:51.640 --> 04:53.240
Huh? Aren't we getting off?

04:53.480 --> 04:55.610
We're supposed to be sightseeing!

04:55.720 --> 04:56.340
Holy shit!

04:57.180 --> 04:57.980
Lookit that!

04:58.080 --> 05:00.780
<i>OKINA WA AQUARIUM</i>

05:01.820 --> 05:03.120
Stop the damn bus!

05:03.220 --> 05:04.750
Lookit all the girls!

05:08.730 --> 05:09.700
No good!

05:09.800 --> 05:11.200
Full of hostile-looking kids!

05:11.300 --> 05:12.060
Too risky...

05:12.170 --> 05:13.430
Definitely too risky.

05:13.530 --> 05:14.630
It's a no-go.

05:15.000 --> 05:16.260
We're off!

05:16.800 --> 05:18.700
We're not getting off again?

05:18.840 --> 05:20.330
Can't we even take a piss?

05:20.440 --> 05:21.640
We're hungry!

05:21.770 --> 05:23.400
You trying to starve us to death?

05:23.510 --> 05:24.700
You said it!

05:25.210 --> 05:25.940
Hey.

05:31.720 --> 05:33.850
You really think that'll work?

05:34.020 --> 05:35.780
Trust me, it'll work.

05:36.020 --> 05:37.920
I don't give a damn about
seeing the sights.

05:38.020 --> 05:40.290
But you want to have
some fun tonight, right?

05:40.460 --> 05:42.090
<i>OKINA WA PREFECTURE MUSEUM</i>

05:42.400 --> 05:43.390
Dammit.

05:43.500 --> 05:45.830
This place is chock-full
of cultural artifacts.

05:45.930 --> 05:47.420
Should we pass up this one, too?

05:47.530 --> 05:48.230
Yankumi!

05:48.330 --> 05:48.930
Huh?

05:50.670 --> 05:52.100
What are you guys doing?

05:52.670 --> 05:54.800
You can't just leave the bus.
Get back inside.

05:54.940 --> 05:56.340
Yamaguchi's It!

05:56.440 --> 05:56.970
Huh?

05:57.080 --> 05:58.010
Ready, set...

05:58.410 --> 05:58.970
...go!

06:00.250 --> 06:01.510
Dammit, come back here!

06:01.610 --> 06:03.080
Are you out of your skulls?

06:03.480 --> 06:04.920
I don't believe those kids!

06:06.290 --> 06:07.880
Come back here, you!

06:07.990 --> 06:09.010
Hold it, Kumai!

06:11.720 --> 06:13.160
Catch us if you can!

06:13.430 --> 06:15.420
Yankumi! You're a slowpoke!

06:15.760 --> 06:16.960
What the hell?

06:17.960 --> 06:18.690
Whoa!

06:23.970 --> 06:25.730
Tag, my ass!

06:25.870 --> 06:27.700
Quit fooling around.

06:27.840 --> 06:29.780
Hey, It, over here, over here!

06:29.940 --> 06:31.410
Over here! Over here!

06:31.510 --> 06:32.540
Over here!

06:32.950 --> 06:34.170
Over here!

06:34.450 --> 06:36.140
I'll kill you...

06:39.320 --> 06:40.750
Hey, come back here!

06:56.540 --> 06:58.730
Now that's enough, young man!

06:58.840 --> 07:00.270
You're not getting away!

07:00.370 --> 07:01.340
Ms. Fujiyama!

07:01.440 --> 07:02.470
Just hold onto him!

07:02.580 --> 07:03.510
OK!

07:03.810 --> 07:05.970
Stop squirming, you!

07:06.750 --> 07:07.810
Oh, my.

07:28.900 --> 07:31.300
They've got lookouts all over the place.

07:31.540 --> 07:35.600
Yeah, I heard Yankumi caught
some guys from Class 3, too.

07:35.780 --> 07:37.570
Shin, what should we do?

07:39.250 --> 07:41.080
What do you say we take off?

07:41.180 --> 07:41.940
Huh?

07:42.050 --> 07:43.310
Do you think we'll make it?

07:44.180 --> 07:45.620
I told you. Trust me.

07:46.420 --> 07:49.050
I'm going to make the
rounds one more time.

07:49.160 --> 07:50.750
Good work!

08:25.590 --> 08:26.820
Yankumi...

08:26.930 --> 08:27.920
We're in the clear.

08:28.030 --> 08:28.720
Come on.

08:41.870 --> 08:45.940
So our "Wear Out Yankumi"
strategy paid off!

08:46.050 --> 08:47.270
Gotta hand it to you, Shin!

08:47.380 --> 08:50.840
You've got the face of a saint,
but a wicked mind...

08:54.190 --> 08:57.060
I don't blame you for being worn out.

09:16.780 --> 09:18.110
Yamaguchi.

09:23.650 --> 09:24.640
S-Sawa...

09:24.750 --> 09:25.410
Shh.

09:25.650 --> 09:27.210
Don't say a word, now.

09:28.390 --> 09:31.220
S-S-Sawada!

09:34.490 --> 09:36.160
You're a dead man!

09:36.900 --> 09:39.260
Are you out of your mind,
you little moron?

09:39.370 --> 09:40.630
Hold on, just calm down!

09:40.730 --> 09:42.200
"Yobai", that's what this is!

09:42.300 --> 09:43.100
N-no, it's not!

09:43.200 --> 09:45.900
How could you do this to me,
your own mentor?

09:46.010 --> 09:47.030
Just listen to me...

09:47.140 --> 09:48.000
The hell I will!

09:51.580 --> 09:54.380
Well, how nice it is to be young...

09:58.180 --> 10:00.240
No! It's not what you think!

10:00.350 --> 10:01.290
Now, don't be shy.

10:01.390 --> 10:02.880
Please, go on.

10:03.220 --> 10:07.460
They didn't call me the
Cupid Bomber for nothing!

10:09.260 --> 10:11.320
People called you that?

10:12.130 --> 10:14.500
I'll just step outside
and kill some time.

10:14.630 --> 10:16.000
Sawada-kun,
how long will you need?

10:16.100 --> 10:17.430
One hour? Two hours?

10:17.540 --> 10:18.160
Huh?

10:18.270 --> 10:19.200
Three hours?

10:19.310 --> 10:20.530
GREAT!

10:20.640 --> 10:21.370
Come on.

10:21.470 --> 10:22.240
Um...

10:23.840 --> 10:25.970
We're here too, you know.

10:27.480 --> 10:29.610
So? What the hell happened?

10:31.320 --> 10:34.120
We went downtown to have some fun.

10:34.450 --> 10:35.610
You guys!

10:35.960 --> 10:39.050
You can save that lecture
for later, all right?

10:39.430 --> 10:40.650
The thing is, Uchi...

10:40.760 --> 10:41.520
Uchi?

10:41.730 --> 10:43.630
Hey, that's right, where's Uchi?

10:44.060 --> 10:45.960
When we were downtown, well...

10:46.200 --> 10:48.330
He kind of hit on this girl...

10:51.340 --> 10:53.310
We're here on vacation, see.

10:53.570 --> 10:56.240
Could you tell us somewhere cool to go?

10:56.380 --> 10:57.600
Let's see...

10:57.710 --> 10:59.010
What do you think you're doing?

10:59.110 --> 11:00.770
Where'd you retards come from?

11:00.910 --> 11:02.010
Shut up!

11:02.180 --> 11:03.270
Get out of my face.

11:03.380 --> 11:04.080
Huh?

11:04.180 --> 11:05.520
Uchi, that's enough.

11:05.920 --> 11:08.010
Hey, what's this, a fight?

11:10.920 --> 11:12.410
Oh, crap!

11:12.730 --> 11:14.130
Let's get out of here!

11:14.230 --> 11:15.130
Hold it!

11:15.230 --> 11:16.490
Come back here!

11:17.900 --> 11:20.090
We lost each other during the getaway.

11:20.370 --> 11:22.800
And we came back to
the hotel separately.

11:22.940 --> 11:24.770
But Uchi's still missing.

11:25.600 --> 11:26.970
How long has it been?

11:28.770 --> 11:30.470
Over an hour.

11:30.940 --> 11:31.970
What about his cell?

11:32.140 --> 11:33.580
We've been calling.

11:33.980 --> 11:34.970
But...

11:35.510 --> 11:37.070
He won't pick up.

11:42.820 --> 11:46.420
This is really, really deep shit.

11:50.460 --> 11:51.450
Really...

11:51.700 --> 11:54.570
How could you let something
screwed up like this happen?

11:54.700 --> 11:56.970
I'm putting this all on your ass.

11:57.200 --> 11:58.170
Why?

12:00.110 --> 12:01.400
Fine, my bad.

12:03.840 --> 12:05.780
That's where we got into the fight.

12:05.910 --> 12:07.000
Around there.

12:08.880 --> 12:10.370
Those dorks!

12:10.480 --> 12:11.140
Hey, you!

12:11.320 --> 12:12.950
What'd you do with my buddy?

12:13.050 --> 12:13.750
Huh?

12:13.920 --> 12:15.290
Who the hell are you?

12:16.590 --> 12:18.520
I'm asking you where he is.

12:18.620 --> 12:20.180
You're that little punk...

12:20.290 --> 12:21.730
Look, dammit...

12:22.030 --> 12:25.800
You're not gonna get anywhere
with that chip on your shoulder.

12:26.130 --> 12:27.460
Who the hell are you?

12:27.830 --> 12:30.170
I'm his homeroom teacher.

12:30.570 --> 12:33.630
There was another kid with him.
Know where he is?

12:34.410 --> 12:36.500
Oh, that one? He croaked!

12:37.010 --> 12:40.100
I killed him and
tossed him into the ocean!

12:41.580 --> 12:43.780
Don't get smart with me.

12:43.920 --> 12:46.820
I hate those kinds of
jokes more than anything.

12:47.490 --> 12:49.750
Who are you to talk?

12:49.860 --> 12:51.260
Slapping him around..

12:51.360 --> 12:52.050
Shut up!

12:52.160 --> 12:53.420
These guys are messing with me!

12:53.530 --> 12:55.120
I'll get you for that, teacher-bitch!

12:55.230 --> 12:56.820
We'll kill you, too!

13:01.700 --> 13:03.930
Where the hell is Uchi?
Damn you!

13:04.070 --> 13:06.840
I was only joking just now.

13:06.970 --> 13:09.570
We chased him for a while,
but he got away.

13:09.680 --> 13:11.540
We haven't seen him since.

13:11.740 --> 13:13.650
It's the truth...it's the truth...

13:13.750 --> 13:17.010
Hey, maybe these guys
really don't know.

13:17.120 --> 13:19.710
Yeah, they definitely have no clue.

13:19.850 --> 13:21.950
Does that mean I went too far?

13:22.050 --> 13:24.320
You definitely went too far.

13:25.620 --> 13:28.820
But really, where the hell did Uchi go?

13:31.160 --> 13:31.930
Brrr...

13:32.060 --> 13:33.400
I've got the chills.

13:33.500 --> 13:36.370
It gets pretty cold at night,
even here in Okinawa.

13:36.470 --> 13:39.100
You shouldn't have come out
here without a jacket.

13:39.210 --> 13:40.400
Well, but hey...

13:42.780 --> 13:44.680
Hey, you have a soft spot...

13:44.810 --> 13:47.800
You're not one of those
who can't resist...

13:49.180 --> 13:51.450
...gorgeous women like me?

13:51.550 --> 13:52.710
Give that back!

13:57.120 --> 14:00.420
Let's go over and ask those guys.

14:00.590 --> 14:01.690
Excuse me?

14:01.790 --> 14:03.760
What, they snatched Uchi?

14:03.900 --> 14:04.830
Amuro!

14:04.960 --> 14:06.590
We just got a call from them!

14:06.700 --> 14:08.190
What, they snatched Uchi?

14:08.300 --> 14:09.290
Why! Who?

14:09.400 --> 14:10.160
For what reason?

14:10.300 --> 14:11.460
Who are you?

14:11.570 --> 14:13.630
You're that teacher we ran into!

14:13.740 --> 14:14.800
Talk to me!

14:15.310 --> 14:16.280
Those guys...

14:16.380 --> 14:18.570
They call themselves
the Mongoose Gang.

14:18.680 --> 14:22.080
They said us Habus had to break up
or they'd kill one of us!

14:22.180 --> 14:23.650
That's why they grabbed Uchi...

14:23.750 --> 14:24.770
What the hell?

14:25.120 --> 14:25.980
Sneaky-ass!

14:26.090 --> 14:27.680
What a sneaky-ass gang!

14:27.850 --> 14:31.260
Don't tell me you're just going
to stand by and do nothing!

14:31.360 --> 14:32.660
Screw that!

14:32.830 --> 14:36.020
We were just saying we should go
after Uchi even if it kills us!

14:36.130 --> 14:37.150
Frickin' A!

14:37.260 --> 14:40.360
They can't scare us with
their bullshit threats!

14:42.030 --> 14:44.770
Really! All right, now
you're talking, guys!

14:44.870 --> 14:46.270
Earth to Yamaguchi...

14:46.370 --> 14:48.400
There's something
strange about this.

14:48.510 --> 14:51.570
Why would these guys get
all pumped up over Uchi?

14:51.680 --> 14:53.240
Someone they don't even know?

14:53.350 --> 14:56.580
Right! They are full of passion,
these Okinawa men!

14:56.750 --> 14:59.080
No, that's not what I meant...

14:59.190 --> 15:00.810
We're going to rescue Uchi!

15:00.920 --> 15:01.620
Yeah!

15:01.720 --> 15:03.050
Okay you cugines, let's go!

15:03.160 --> 15:03.880
Yeah!

15:03.990 --> 15:05.220
One more time for good measure!

15:05.320 --> 15:06.380
Yeah!

15:13.370 --> 15:14.230
Go to hell!

15:14.330 --> 15:15.630
Don't screw with us!

15:15.770 --> 15:17.200
Hand over Uchi!

15:17.940 --> 15:18.700
Hey.

15:18.900 --> 15:21.030
Just shut up and hand him over.

15:21.240 --> 15:23.400
Or do you want to fight, assholes?

15:23.580 --> 15:27.510
It's your own fault for not
breaking up like we told you to.

15:27.610 --> 15:28.270
Yo!

15:30.720 --> 15:32.150
What the hell?

15:32.250 --> 15:34.150
When did they get here?

15:34.390 --> 15:35.550
This is really low!

15:35.650 --> 15:36.880
If you say so...

15:38.820 --> 15:39.720
Cut the crap!

15:40.090 --> 15:42.080
We're taking Uchi back so screw off!

15:42.190 --> 15:43.160
Right!

15:43.260 --> 15:44.750
I'm about to cry.

15:46.230 --> 15:48.330
Come on, let's settle this, Amuro.

15:48.430 --> 15:52.770
This town isn't big enough for
both the Mongoose and Habu gangs.

15:55.510 --> 15:57.480
So your gang's history.

16:01.180 --> 16:01.940
Hey!

16:05.080 --> 16:07.820
Are you the leader of
this Mongoose Gang?

16:08.020 --> 16:09.680
Who the hell are you?

16:09.790 --> 16:12.160
I'm not gonna go easy on you
just because you're a woman.

16:12.260 --> 16:13.490
Come on, cut it out.

16:13.660 --> 16:15.990
We brought you because
we were carried away.

16:16.130 --> 16:17.600
But this is between us and them.

16:17.730 --> 16:20.100
I don't want you to
get mixed up in this.

16:20.200 --> 16:22.500
So you're not such a bad guy.

16:22.840 --> 16:25.100
But I'm so mixed up in this.

16:25.470 --> 16:26.670
Outta my way.

16:27.470 --> 16:30.240
Okay, why don't you hand over Uchi?

16:30.410 --> 16:32.610
You gotta be friggin' kidding me.

16:32.750 --> 16:34.710
Cough him up and no one will get hurt.

16:34.810 --> 16:36.040
Otherwise...

16:36.180 --> 16:37.670
Otherwise?

16:40.350 --> 16:42.910
I'll take him back myself or die trying!

16:43.290 --> 16:44.220
Jesus...

16:44.390 --> 16:46.260
You'd go that far for Uchi?

16:48.290 --> 16:49.850
This sounds interesting.

16:49.960 --> 16:51.760
Go ahead, make my day...

17:18.260 --> 17:19.490
Hold on, hold on!

17:19.690 --> 17:22.390
My underlings did this
without my knowledge...

17:22.490 --> 17:23.150
Huh?

17:23.860 --> 17:25.490
Don't look at me!

17:26.630 --> 17:28.290
Hey, come on, Boss!

17:28.400 --> 17:30.530
We were just following your orders!

17:31.200 --> 17:31.930
Yeah?

17:32.040 --> 17:34.130
So you're the ones who snatched Uchi?

17:37.140 --> 17:38.010
You assholes!

17:38.110 --> 17:40.200
Don't let me catch you
playing dirty again!

17:40.310 --> 17:43.010
Or next time I swear
I'll rip your balls off!

17:43.120 --> 17:44.520
Jesus Christ...

17:44.950 --> 17:46.040
We found Uchi!

17:46.190 --> 17:47.280
He's all right!

17:49.190 --> 17:49.950
Uchi!

17:50.760 --> 17:51.690
Uchi!

17:53.760 --> 17:55.490
I was so worried, dammit!

17:55.590 --> 17:56.990
Uchi!

18:01.370 --> 18:02.200
Who's this?

18:03.200 --> 18:04.070
Who's that?

18:04.170 --> 18:06.400
This is "Uchi" a.k.a. Uchida.

18:09.540 --> 18:11.030
A misunderstanding, huh?

18:11.140 --> 18:12.910
I thought it was kinda weird!

18:14.010 --> 18:15.040
Amuro-san...

18:15.150 --> 18:15.770
Right.

18:16.120 --> 18:17.450
Ane-san Sensei...

18:17.580 --> 18:21.280
I can see you're worried
sick about this Uchi kid.

18:21.820 --> 18:25.260
I know it was a misunderstanding,
but we still owe you big time.

18:25.360 --> 18:29.450
Come on, Habus, we're gonna hit
the streets and find her Uchi!

18:29.560 --> 18:30.290
Right!

18:30.400 --> 18:31.520
You guys!

18:31.630 --> 18:33.930
So what does this kid look like?

18:35.830 --> 18:38.900
His face is like this,
and his hair's like this.

18:40.470 --> 18:42.410
That's him, more or less.

19:00.590 --> 19:02.080
Ow!

19:04.260 --> 19:04.890
Huh?

19:05.930 --> 19:07.460
Did I fall asleep?

19:08.070 --> 19:08.800
All right.

19:09.000 --> 19:10.940
Then go take a look near the water.

19:11.100 --> 19:12.970
I'm gonna swing by the park.

19:21.110 --> 19:23.710
Please tell me they've given up.

19:29.120 --> 19:30.490
Is that you, Uchi?

19:31.690 --> 19:33.320
I've been looking for you.

19:37.330 --> 19:39.060
You're that guy who...

19:39.830 --> 19:41.630
I didn't come here to fight.

19:41.730 --> 19:42.260
Huh?

19:42.570 --> 19:43.540
Get on.

19:43.640 --> 19:45.500
What kind of trick is this?

19:45.600 --> 19:47.900
I'm going to take you to
where Ane-san Sensei's waiting.

19:48.010 --> 19:49.370
Ane-san Sensei?

19:49.610 --> 19:52.600
That teacher of yours
came through for us, see.

19:52.710 --> 19:53.840
Yankumi did?

19:53.950 --> 19:55.540
That teacher kicks ass.

19:55.680 --> 19:58.080
You shouldn't make her worry so much.

19:59.250 --> 20:02.480
She's one in a million, that teach!

20:03.460 --> 20:07.520
We rounded up everyone who matched
your sketch, Ane-san Sensei!

20:07.630 --> 20:08.990
Wrong guy, wrong guy,
wrong guy...

20:09.090 --> 20:09.860
Wrong guy, wrong guy...

20:09.960 --> 20:11.260
Wrong guy!

20:11.430 --> 20:13.420
Not one of them is Uchi!

20:13.530 --> 20:16.090
Oh, I thought they were
all dead ringers!

20:17.240 --> 20:18.140
Is that...

20:19.810 --> 20:21.640
Huh! Uchi!

20:23.180 --> 20:24.670
So you survived.

20:25.440 --> 20:26.840
Yankumi!

20:26.950 --> 20:28.350
Uchi!

20:28.510 --> 20:30.070
Yankumi!

20:30.220 --> 20:32.310
Uchi!

20:32.820 --> 20:36.810
Yankumi, I'm sorry!

20:37.220 --> 20:39.350
Uchi!

20:39.490 --> 20:40.820
Yankumi!

20:42.060 --> 20:44.390
This game of tag is over, Uchi!

20:47.070 --> 20:49.330
Ow!

20:51.200 --> 20:52.170
He's back!

20:52.270 --> 20:53.930
Hey, Uchi's back!

20:55.470 --> 20:56.240
Uchi!

20:56.340 --> 20:57.900
Dickhead, what the hell...

20:58.210 --> 20:59.300
Whoa!

20:59.750 --> 21:01.150
Who the hell is that?

21:01.250 --> 21:02.810
What happened to your face?

21:02.920 --> 21:04.440
Hey man, stop crying...

21:04.550 --> 21:05.280
Hey...

21:12.760 --> 21:13.730
Ojou!

21:13.830 --> 21:15.290
Welcome home!

21:16.500 --> 21:18.560
It was an ordeal!

21:19.400 --> 21:20.330
Ojou...

21:20.630 --> 21:24.500
Your faithful servant Fuji has
eagerly awaited your return...

21:24.600 --> 21:28.370
Thank you for coming back safely!

21:29.940 --> 21:30.570
Here.

21:30.710 --> 21:32.110
It's a souvenir from Okinawa.

21:32.210 --> 21:34.440
Hey, this is one of those Shiisa things...

21:34.610 --> 21:36.450
Ojou, thank you very much.

21:37.150 --> 21:37.810
Huh?

21:37.980 --> 21:40.320
I got these for you, Consigliere!

21:40.450 --> 21:42.250
Well, thank you.

21:42.690 --> 21:46.320
Now that's pretty blatant,
don't you think?

22:06.140 --> 22:16.140
<i>We are all born</i>
<i>crying out to the world.</i>

22:17.190 --> 22:27.120
<i>Because of all the endless grief</i>
<i>that we must go through in life.</i>

22:27.900 --> 22:37.610
<i>All of the heartache</i>
<i>is such a heavy load to bear.</i>

22:37.910 --> 22:42.810
<i>On those days when</i>
<i>I am alone and cold...</i>

22:43.050 --> 22:47.950
<i>...I'll light a fire</i>
<i>with my own two hands.</i>

22:48.390 --> 22:53.330
<i>The treacherous mountains</i>
<i>are my chosen path.</i>

22:53.490 --> 23:00.260
<i>I'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>without a backward glance.</i>

23:15.450 --> 23:20.580
Summer wouldn't be summer
without all those festivals.

23:20.690 --> 23:23.750
And I'm a true Edo man.
I just can't sit still...

23:23.890 --> 23:26.220
...when it comes to festivals!

23:26.560 --> 23:30.390
So what's this about a brawl,
today of all days?

23:30.530 --> 23:34.300
Who in their right mind would
pull a heinous stunt like that?

23:34.430 --> 23:35.230
Next episode!

23:35.370 --> 23:38.930
Schoolground Battle
Without Honor or Humanity!

23:39.140 --> 23:43.230
Ojou, you can always count on me!
